<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CKS Group initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CKS Group initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Shaun Andrikopoulos initiated coverage of CKS Group Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- CKS shares rose 3/8 to 25-7/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
